Chapter: VectorWideAvxLocalAdmitted
  cites Foreword chapter Console

Section: Entry

 Compiled with `avx-local`: the start-up refusal is suppressed, and the
 program reads the admission cell (36384) itself before any 256-bit work.

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    if peek-qword 36384 0 == 0 then print-line-uni "avx not admitted, lanes skipped"
    else print-line-uni ("lane " & show (vec4d-extract (vec4d-splat 1.5 + vec4d-splat 2.0) 0))
  end
